                <h3 class="postingHeader">Job Description and Duties</h3>
                <p class="postingContent">
                    <span style="font-size: 12pt;">Non-sworn uniformed seasonal security staff provide for the safety and security of the Cal Expo Fairgrounds property, to include physical security screening, mobile (vehicle) security patrols, and assigned (fixed) security posts.<br /><br /> </span><p>You will find additional information about the job in the <strong><a href='https://www.CalCareers.ca.gov/CalHrPublic/FileDownload.aspx?aid=26525082&name=DutyStatement-SFWSeasonalSecurityGuard2024.pdf' target='_blank'>Duty Statement</a></strong>.</p>
                </p>
            
