                <h3 class="postingHeader">Working Conditions</h3>
                <p class="postingContent">
                    <ul style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;">
			<li style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Works near fast-moving machinery or traffic. </span></li><li style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Performs other duties requiring high physical demand.</span></li><li style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Prolonged periods of sitting, standing, kneeling, bending, and lifting.</span></li><li style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">May be exposed to extreme temperatures, airborne dust, fumes, vapors, chemicals, medical waste and blood borne pathogen.</span></li></ul>
                </p>
            
